# name: paddle-subscription-payments
# priority: 3590
# section: payments
# description: Paddle 订阅支付、结账、商家 API、账单与 Retain
# boundary: 从 Paddle.js 生产环境字段跟随当前 Retain 脚本，覆盖结账、商家 API、账单与恢复支付接口；共享 ProfitWell 主机上的其他请求也随本表匹配。开发与预发布环境单独排除，其他支付处理方保留各自规则。
# created-at: 2026-11-26T16:38:35Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-26T17:30:39Z
# source: https://www.paddle.com/
# source: https://www.paddle.net/
# source: https://developer.paddle.com/paddle-js/about/include-paddlejs/
# source: https://cdn.paddle.com/paddle/v2/paddle.js
# source: https://developer.paddle.com/build/retain/
# source: https://www.paddle.com/vulnerability-disclosure-policy
# canonical-rule-count: 6
# rule-count: 6
# format: quantumult-x
# canonical: rules/loon/3590-paddle-subscription-payments.lsr

host-suffix,paddle.com,proxy
host-suffix,paddle.net,proxy
host,public.profitwell.com,proxy
host,api.profitwell-events.com,proxy
host,retain-api.profitwell.com,proxy
host,www2.profitwell.com,proxy
